WEBVTT

00:00:02.030 --> 00:00:08.400
I can't come to hate you,
but it's just really not enough.

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:16.230
Did you know that when you think
about it, you know little about yourself?

00:00:18.610 --> 00:00:22.050
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:00:22.150 --> 00:00:27.210
When you're about
to give up all hope, look at the sky...

00:00:28.620 --> 00:00:34.120
...because the wind
will gently dry all your tears.

00:00:35.290 --> 00:00:38.090
And then the light
that floods down...

00:00:38.430 --> 00:00:45.060
...from the big stars in the sky will come
down and gently wrap all around you.

00:00:48.410 --> 00:00:53.210
A magical jewel...
Everything you want...

00:00:53.350 --> 00:01:00.410
...is in a haze much thicker
than any dream you have had.

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:06.650
I can't come to hate you,
but it's just really not enough.

00:01:07.660 --> 00:01:12.620
I have my faith that what I feel is all true.

00:01:13.630 --> 00:01:20.060
Breaking through the wall of steel,
I can now see on the other side.

00:01:20.710 --> 00:01:27.980
The sea that opens to tomorrow,
and it will be shining for me.

00:01:32.420 --> 00:01:33.820
Clef told me.

00:01:33.920 --> 00:01:37.680
That you were the only
magic swordsman in Cephiro.

00:01:44.230 --> 00:01:48.000
Can't you give up on
the Pillar of Cephiro?

00:01:48.930 --> 00:01:50.200
I cannot...

00:01:51.140 --> 00:01:54.470
My country needs the Pillar system.

00:02:26.540 --> 00:02:32.500
Eagle and the Captive Hikaru

00:02:49.190 --> 00:02:50.250
Selece!

00:02:52.600 --> 00:02:53.830
Windam!

00:03:09.380 --> 00:03:11.140
Hikaru is in danger.

00:03:12.220 --> 00:03:14.080
You heard it too, Ms. Umi?

00:03:16.690 --> 00:03:18.550
What happened, Hikaru?

00:03:19.860 --> 00:03:21.330
I do not know.

00:03:21.430 --> 00:03:24.620
However, I do know that
Ms. Hikaru is in danger.

00:03:24.730 --> 00:03:26.490
Let's go, Fuu.

00:03:27.430 --> 00:03:28.560
Yes!

00:03:40.680 --> 00:03:43.150
Everyone should just perish!

00:03:54.790 --> 00:03:56.730
I will not let you go.

00:03:58.360 --> 00:04:01.560
I will never let you go, Lord Zagato!

00:04:04.340 --> 00:04:05.800
Astra!

00:04:09.210 --> 00:04:10.640
Lantis!

00:04:21.350 --> 00:04:24.050
I feel an ominous presence from you.

00:04:25.290 --> 00:04:28.380
The presence that
surrounds all of Cephiro...

00:04:29.530 --> 00:04:31.830
Tell me. What is that presence?

00:04:33.970 --> 00:04:36.730
It's Lady Debonair, Lord Zagato.

00:04:38.340 --> 00:04:39.770
Zagato is...

00:04:40.140 --> 00:04:41.700
...no longer here.

00:04:41.810 --> 00:04:43.210
Lord Zagato...

00:04:44.040 --> 00:04:46.270
My dear Lord Zagato...

00:04:46.740 --> 00:04:47.730
Answer me!

00:04:47.850 --> 00:04:50.580
Who is Debonair? Where is she?

00:04:53.650 --> 00:04:56.950
Lady Debonair is right by our sides.

00:04:58.020 --> 00:04:59.420
Our sides?

00:05:16.210 --> 00:05:18.270
Lantis!

00:05:22.150 --> 00:05:24.140
I'm going to go after Hikaru.

00:05:28.490 --> 00:05:31.580
You can communicate
with Master Mage Clef, right?

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:35.090
Please do.

00:05:38.300 --> 00:05:40.030
Creature Summon!

00:05:47.940 --> 00:05:49.500
Wait, I'll go too!

00:05:56.110 --> 00:06:00.180
Hey, get out of my way!
I'm gonna go with Lantis!

00:06:03.290 --> 00:06:05.550
Lantis!

00:06:26.180 --> 00:06:28.110
Don't close your eyes.

00:06:29.850 --> 00:06:30.970
Hikaru...

00:06:31.520 --> 00:06:33.950
Soon... Soon I can meet you.

00:06:34.050 --> 00:06:35.520
Who is it?

00:06:36.820 --> 00:06:38.150
I'm Nova.

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:41.790
I was born for you, Hikaru.

00:06:41.890 --> 00:06:44.160
Our existence is the same.

00:06:44.700 --> 00:06:46.060
As me?

00:06:46.930 --> 00:06:48.060
Hikaru...

00:06:51.400 --> 00:06:54.240
I was born just for you, Hikaru.

00:06:55.440 --> 00:06:56.870
Just for you.

00:07:00.580 --> 00:07:02.840
Because you are...

00:07:25.140 --> 00:07:27.800
You are Cephiro's...

00:07:37.750 --> 00:07:39.610
Wait, Nova!

00:07:41.150 --> 00:07:42.410
Nova!

00:08:00.070 --> 00:08:01.300
This is...

00:08:13.250 --> 00:08:17.190
That's right. I was fighting that
white machine, and I passed out.

00:08:17.290 --> 00:08:18.950
Girl from another world...

00:08:19.060 --> 00:08:20.150
Rayearth...

00:08:21.260 --> 00:08:24.490
I'm sorry. It was because
I couldn't fight properly...

00:08:24.600 --> 00:08:26.860
Are you... Are you all right?

00:08:27.200 --> 00:08:29.330
Girl from another world...

00:08:29.430 --> 00:08:34.270
When thou lost consciousness,
I was returned to my own dimension.

00:08:34.370 --> 00:08:36.240
Then you weren't hurt.

00:08:36.340 --> 00:08:37.500
I'm glad.

00:08:37.810 --> 00:08:42.370
If danger befalls thee,
be sure to call my name.

00:08:43.050 --> 00:08:44.380
Always.

00:08:44.480 --> 00:08:46.580
Thank you, Rayearth.

00:08:54.360 --> 00:08:55.690
You're up?

00:08:59.800 --> 00:09:01.030
These clothes...

00:09:01.130 --> 00:09:04.400
Oh, we're analyzing
your clothes right now.

00:09:04.500 --> 00:09:05.940
Analyzing?

00:09:06.170 --> 00:09:10.110
When we get the data, we'll
clean them and properly return them.

00:09:12.740 --> 00:09:14.180
Can you stand?

00:09:19.980 --> 00:09:21.320
T-Thanks.

00:09:21.850 --> 00:09:23.120
You're cute.

00:09:24.090 --> 00:09:28.150
Oops, if we don't hurry,
Geo will make fun of me again.

00:09:29.560 --> 00:09:30.650
This way.

00:09:36.200 --> 00:09:38.530
Hang on tight or you'll fall off!

00:09:38.770 --> 00:09:39.740
Right!

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:44.040
Hey, what's your name?

00:09:44.140 --> 00:09:45.300
Hikaru Shidou.

00:09:45.410 --> 00:09:46.500
Shido...

00:09:46.610 --> 00:09:48.550
Everyone calls me Hikaru.

00:09:48.950 --> 00:09:52.210
Hikaru, huh?
Even your name's cute...

00:09:52.320 --> 00:09:53.250
What?

00:09:53.650 --> 00:09:54.740
Nothing...

00:10:08.270 --> 00:10:10.030
Well, go on in.

00:10:26.480 --> 00:10:28.950
Don't make any sudden movements.

00:10:32.190 --> 00:10:34.320
There's a magnetic field...

00:10:34.430 --> 00:10:38.360
...built into my FTO's barrier that
can shock one's nervous system.

00:10:40.500 --> 00:10:43.960
The pain and haziness will recede soon.

00:10:44.840 --> 00:10:46.930
I'm sorry I was so rough.

00:10:51.480 --> 00:10:53.740
Let me reintroduce myself.

00:10:54.310 --> 00:10:56.750
I'm Eagle Vision of Autozam.

00:10:56.910 --> 00:10:59.680
Commander of this ship, the NSX.

00:11:06.420 --> 00:11:11.560
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:11:13.430 --> 00:11:17.560
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:11:36.420 --> 00:11:40.650
But are you really one of those
legendary Magic Knights, little miss?

00:11:43.690 --> 00:11:46.320
I'm Geo Metro.
Little miss, what's your name?

00:11:46.430 --> 00:11:48.520
Hikaru. Hikaru Shidou.

00:11:49.530 --> 00:11:51.130
Interesting name.

00:11:51.240 --> 00:11:53.070
It's a cute name!

00:11:53.700 --> 00:11:56.540
I'm Zazu. Zazu Torque.
Nice to meet you.

00:11:56.770 --> 00:11:58.500
S-Same here.

00:11:59.140 --> 00:12:03.380
Oh, by the way...
Are you really a girl, little miss?

00:12:04.050 --> 00:12:08.250
Hey, the people of Cephiro's mental
states can affect their age, right?

00:12:08.350 --> 00:12:09.610
I-It seems so.

00:12:09.720 --> 00:12:13.420
Well then, are you actually
an older woman, little miss?

00:12:13.520 --> 00:12:16.050
Could you be much older than me?

00:12:16.360 --> 00:12:19.120
I-I don't dislike older women though!

00:12:22.000 --> 00:12:23.930
I turned fourteen this year.

00:12:24.170 --> 00:12:25.260
Fourteen?

00:12:25.400 --> 00:12:27.560
Yeah! She's younger than me!

00:12:27.670 --> 00:12:29.660
But she's not shorter.

00:12:29.770 --> 00:12:31.610
I'm gonna keep growing!

00:12:31.710 --> 00:12:34.540
Why don't ya grow
taller than the FTO?

00:12:34.910 --> 00:12:35.970
I...

00:12:37.480 --> 00:12:40.310
I come from Tokyo, not Cephiro.

00:12:40.750 --> 00:12:41.910
Tokyo?

00:12:42.120 --> 00:12:44.520
A place you call another world.

00:12:48.290 --> 00:12:50.160
Another world, is it...

00:12:52.230 --> 00:12:55.720
The legend that only those
summoned from another world...

00:12:55.830 --> 00:12:58.670
...could become
Magic Knights was true after all.

00:12:59.740 --> 00:13:01.640
You know about the Magic Knights?

00:13:06.710 --> 00:13:10.040
Well, cute little miss,
I'll see you later.

00:13:10.350 --> 00:13:11.310
Hey...

00:13:11.720 --> 00:13:13.650
See you later, Hikaru!

00:13:25.200 --> 00:13:27.160
Would you like some sweets?

00:13:32.940 --> 00:13:35.270
Geo has a sweet tooth.

00:13:35.670 --> 00:13:38.230
We come here for
every strategy meeting.

00:13:38.340 --> 00:13:41.280
So he keeps a stash
of sweets for himself here.

00:13:41.880 --> 00:13:43.810
Let's eat it together.

00:13:47.750 --> 00:13:49.690
Do you like sweets?

00:13:51.660 --> 00:13:53.090
I love them.

00:13:53.560 --> 00:13:54.620
I'm glad.

00:13:54.930 --> 00:13:57.620
But I'd feel sorry for... Geo, was it?

00:13:57.730 --> 00:13:59.220
...if we ate it all.

00:13:59.330 --> 00:14:03.560
It's all right. I know Geo hides
another stash of sweets in his room.

00:14:04.070 --> 00:14:06.000
So let's eat it all.

00:14:13.280 --> 00:14:14.570
Um, Fuu...

00:14:15.250 --> 00:14:16.180
Yes?

00:14:17.520 --> 00:14:18.950
About Hikaru...

00:14:19.520 --> 00:14:22.180
Don't you think she's
been acting weird lately?

00:14:24.190 --> 00:14:26.280
You noticed too, Ms. Umi?

00:14:27.220 --> 00:14:31.320
This time too, she asked out
of the blue to go by herself...

00:14:32.330 --> 00:14:36.770
She does not seem to be sleeping
well... And when we are conversing...

00:14:36.870 --> 00:14:38.560
...she sometimes looks dazed.

00:14:38.670 --> 00:14:41.570
As if she was having a daydream...

00:14:42.140 --> 00:14:45.270
Yeah, like she was
having some nightmare.

00:14:45.380 --> 00:14:48.900
Suddenly going quiet
or looking like she's about to cry...

00:14:49.010 --> 00:14:53.640
I'm worried since Hikaru tries to put
everything on her own shoulders.

00:14:53.750 --> 00:14:58.690
She tries to solve every problem
alone, no matter how tough or painful...

00:14:59.620 --> 00:15:02.290
I may sound arrogant saying this...

00:15:02.390 --> 00:15:06.020
...but I'd like to know
if anything is causing Hikaru pain.

00:15:06.130 --> 00:15:08.620
I probably can't be of much use...

00:15:08.730 --> 00:15:11.700
...but I can at least be there for her.

00:15:11.800 --> 00:15:15.030
You are truly kind, Ms. Umi.

00:15:15.410 --> 00:15:18.140
W-What are you
saying all of the sudden?

00:15:18.910 --> 00:15:21.100
You truly are kind.

00:15:22.610 --> 00:15:26.010
It makes me nervous
when you compliment me.

00:15:26.120 --> 00:15:28.050
I have no ulterior motives.

00:15:31.060 --> 00:15:34.680
In any case, it is certain that
something happened to Ms. Hikaru.

00:15:34.790 --> 00:15:35.950
Let's hurry.

00:15:40.900 --> 00:15:44.130
Lantis is currently in Cephiro, right?

00:15:44.740 --> 00:15:46.400
You know Lantis?

00:15:47.070 --> 00:15:51.130
I believe Autozam was
the country he stayed in longest...

00:15:51.240 --> 00:15:55.340
...between his departure
from and return to Cephiro.

00:15:56.010 --> 00:15:57.950
You were friends with him?

00:15:59.280 --> 00:16:01.220
How do I put this...

00:16:01.320 --> 00:16:03.980
You're familiar with my FTO, right?

00:16:04.090 --> 00:16:05.750
That white machine?

00:16:08.130 --> 00:16:13.190
Around when Lantis came to Autozam,
there was a test for fighters.

00:16:14.230 --> 00:16:15.460
Fighters...

00:17:08.590 --> 00:17:11.820
And before that,
my FTO was undefeated.

00:17:15.990 --> 00:17:19.590
So I met him, wondering
what kind of person he was...

00:17:21.900 --> 00:17:25.060
Don't you think Lantis is
withdrawn and expressionless?

00:17:25.170 --> 00:17:26.100
Yeah.

00:17:27.100 --> 00:17:28.200
But...

00:17:29.040 --> 00:17:30.560
...he's kind.

00:17:31.680 --> 00:17:32.940
I agree.

00:17:35.550 --> 00:17:38.170
But I betrayed him.

00:17:41.790 --> 00:17:43.120
It's nothing.

00:17:46.790 --> 00:17:52.060
I want you to tell me. Why is
Autozam trying to invade Cephiro?

00:17:57.400 --> 00:18:01.030
Autozam is a country
that's extremely mechanized.

00:18:02.040 --> 00:18:04.470
Quantifying mental energy...

00:18:04.580 --> 00:18:08.070
...and using that as the force
to drive the nation forward.

00:18:08.180 --> 00:18:09.870
Mental energy?

00:18:14.180 --> 00:18:16.450
A fully-automated world.

00:18:16.750 --> 00:18:20.160
A social order that grew
even out of human hands.

00:18:20.260 --> 00:18:24.280
And one day,
the limit suddenly fell on us.

00:18:26.100 --> 00:18:28.290
The world was so mechanized...

00:18:28.400 --> 00:18:32.960
...that as the price for convenience,
it took mental energy from the people.

00:18:34.570 --> 00:18:39.770
You can imagine what happened to
a country upheld by mental energy...

00:18:40.340 --> 00:18:42.610
...once the source was gone.

00:18:44.620 --> 00:18:47.710
At this rate, Autozam will be ruined.

00:18:48.850 --> 00:18:52.250
I am seeking a larger
source of mental energy.

00:18:52.360 --> 00:18:55.920
In other words, something with
the power to support all Cephiro...

00:18:56.030 --> 00:18:57.550
...the Pillar system.

00:18:58.230 --> 00:18:59.990
But the Pillar is...

00:19:03.470 --> 00:19:05.160
These are your clothes.

00:19:05.270 --> 00:19:07.360
I'm sorry we borrowed them.

00:19:09.440 --> 00:19:10.840
That glove...

00:19:11.070 --> 00:19:15.530
When we tried to measure its
mental energy, it went off the scale.

00:19:17.750 --> 00:19:19.680
Are you going to change?

00:19:20.520 --> 00:19:22.920
You do look cute in that outfit though.

00:19:23.020 --> 00:19:24.950
Zazu made that outfit.

00:19:27.660 --> 00:19:31.650
Zazu was really happy
that a cute girl came here.

00:19:33.260 --> 00:19:34.360
Eagle!

00:19:35.700 --> 00:19:39.470
The Pillar of Cephiro
is a very sad thing to be.

00:19:39.570 --> 00:19:43.940
It's a very sad person who's not
allowed to do anything for themselves.

00:19:44.410 --> 00:19:45.500
I know.

00:19:45.940 --> 00:19:48.040
I heard it from Lantis.

00:19:48.150 --> 00:19:49.480
Then why?

00:20:05.530 --> 00:20:06.660
Lantis!

00:20:07.730 --> 00:20:10.100
I want you to return Hikaru.

00:20:11.070 --> 00:20:13.000
That would be a problem.

00:20:14.340 --> 00:20:15.330
Lantis!

00:20:23.410 --> 00:20:25.610
You're still strong as ever.

00:20:25.720 --> 00:20:28.280
Eagle, why did
you come to Cephiro?

00:20:28.390 --> 00:20:31.010
Autozam, without
assistance, is doomed.

00:20:31.120 --> 00:20:33.890
Using Cephiro's
Pillar system is the only way.

00:20:33.990 --> 00:20:36.590
So you're going to
sacrifice yourself?

00:20:41.470 --> 00:20:42.960
Eagle, what's wrong?

00:20:43.170 --> 00:20:44.760
Did something happen?

00:20:46.500 --> 00:20:47.560
Hikaru...

00:20:48.040 --> 00:20:48.970
Nova?

00:20:49.310 --> 00:20:51.170
I can finally meet you.

00:20:51.280 --> 00:20:52.740
This presence...

00:21:09.490 --> 00:21:10.590
This is...

00:21:44.830 --> 00:21:45.990
Finally.

00:21:46.100 --> 00:21:48.690
Finally we meet, Hikaru.

00:21:50.870 --> 00:21:53.170
Hello, Hikaru.

00:21:55.940 --> 00:21:57.370
I'm Nova.

00:21:57.710 --> 00:21:59.540
The one who will kill you.

00:22:01.610 --> 00:22:03.050
Nova?

00:22:18.900 --> 00:22:24.330
You are like the fast wind that blows
across the surface of the ocean.

00:22:24.970 --> 00:22:32.240
And all the dreams you have are always
engulfed in infinite rays of sunlight.

00:22:33.710 --> 00:22:39.240
I don't want to see you with your back
turned to me like you are right now.

00:22:39.950 --> 00:22:43.750
Heading toward the future,
both your wings are broken...

00:22:44.120 --> 00:22:46.520
...yet you hide your pain from me.

00:22:48.330 --> 00:22:51.620
Softly...
Let me wipe all your tears away.

00:22:52.000 --> 00:22:55.360
Softly...
Let me hold you in my embrace.

00:22:55.770 --> 00:23:02.700
Softly... Let me comfort you in my arms
because I want you to be at peace.

00:23:03.110 --> 00:23:06.540
I'll give you... I'll give you...

00:23:06.840 --> 00:23:15.270
Even if you rest your wings now, the
dreams that you see now will not end...

00:23:18.120 --> 00:23:21.450
I'll give you... I'll give you...

00:23:21.690 --> 00:23:29.760
If you have a heart that believes,
I'm sure it will be of help to you...

00:23:31.840 --> 00:23:38.640
I'll give you my love lullaby...

00:23:47.150 --> 00:23:49.280
I'm Hikaru Shidou!

00:23:49.390 --> 00:23:53.120
That voice I've been hearing all
this time. The girl that appeared...

00:23:53.220 --> 00:23:54.780
...called herself Nova.

00:23:54.890 --> 00:23:56.360
She's Nova?

00:23:56.660 --> 00:24:00.390
While I was still confused,
she started attacking me.

00:24:00.500 --> 00:24:02.520
I fought back with magic...

00:24:02.630 --> 00:24:06.590
...but Nova can use all of
my spells and got me instead!

00:24:06.940 --> 00:24:08.730
Magic Knight Rayearth...

00:24:08.840 --> 00:24:10.370
Nova and Regalia,
Rune-God of the Devil.

00:24:10.370 --> 00:24:11.940
Nova and Regalia,
Rune-God of the Devil
Nova and Regalia,
Rune-God of the Devil.

00:24:11.940 --> 00:24:14.380
Nova and Regalia,
Rune-God of the Devil
You have to watch it!

00:24:14.380 --> 00:24:21.310
Who is it today?

00:24:22.350 --> 00:24:24.290
Today, it's Primera!

00:24:24.390 --> 00:24:24.650
Look forward to the next episode!

00:24:24.650 --> 00:24:27.820
Look forward to the next episode!
You have to watch the next episode!

00:24:27.820 --> 00:24:30.350
Look forward to the next episode!
